{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1479806-burning-lair-trait","id":1479806,"title":"Burning Lair trait","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-30T07:14:37-07:00","id":1479806,"title":"Burning Lair trait","content":"Hey guys how are you doing? I hope fine!<br /> <br /> I was reading the Lair traits section on core book and it says most of lair traits are tilts, but when you look the Major trait Burning it says it only sets your chambers on fire per fire rules, so i was thinking if a insatiable invade a lair with Burning trait he wont be able to avoid the fire with the Ensuriment \u201cLass of man no longer apply?\u201d Or he will need to dealth with the fire on another way? I imagining a scenario where the beast player got Burning trait at maximum damage ( inferno 3+ 3 intensity). Whats your guys thoughts about that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-30T08:27:06-07:00","id":1479811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thiagocord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1479806-burning-lair-trait#post1479806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey guys how are you doing? I hope fine!<br /> <br /> I was reading the Lair traits section on core book and it says most of lair traits are tilts, but when you look the Major trait Burning it says it only sets your chambers on fire per fire rules, so i was thinking if a insatiable invade a lair with Burning trait he wont be able to avoid the fire with the Ensuriment \u201cLass of man no longer apply?\u201d Or he will need to dealth with the fire on another way?</div> </div> </div> </div>Laws of Man No Longer Apply only negates penalties, which doesn't help it deal with actual fire. It will hold off the penalties from Extreme Heat or Extreme Cold in a way that can reasonably be interpreted to stop them from rolling over to lethal damage, but making fire not burn you is a little closer to &quot;sweeping changes to the environment&quot; than &quot;nudging the laws of thermodynamics.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-30T08:59:10-07:00","id":1479814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1479806-burning-lair-trait?p=1479811#post1479811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Laws of Man No Longer Apply only negates penalties, which doesn't help it deal with actual fire. It will hold off the penalties from Extreme Heat or Extreme Cold in a way that can reasonably be interpreted to stop them from rolling over to lethal damage, but making fire not burn you is a little closer to &amp;quot;sweeping changes to the environment&amp;quot; than &amp;quot;nudging the laws of thermodynamics.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>So insatiables dont have any counter measure against burning lair trait? Their will really be taking 6 dmg turn?<br /> <br /> If i recall well heroes have a gift to null lair traits, it would be nice if insatiables have something like that.<br /> <br /> Their seem a lot less dangerous now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-30T14:36:46-07:00","id":1479837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thiagocord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1479806-burning-lair-trait?p=1479814#post1479814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So insatiables dont have any counter measure against burning lair trait? Their will really be taking 6 dmg turn?</div> </div> </div> </div>If they engage with the Trait.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If i recall well heroes have a gift to null lair traits, it would be nice if insatiables have something like that. </div> </div> </div>They can manage this by stealing Dragonfire or another Atavism that gives them immunity to fire damage, in addition to being able to have a general Armor rating through that being one of the effects of the Merger that their true forms can replicate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-01T14:53:57-07:00","id":1479914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1479806-burning-lair-trait?p=1479837#post1479837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they engage with the Trait.<br /> <br /> They can manage this by stealing Dragonfire or another Atavism that gives them immunity to fire damage, in addition to being able to have a general Armor rating through that being one of the effects of the Merger that their true forms can replicate.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see, you give me nice ideas to work around this lair trait, thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}